  - seconds: 3736
    speaker: Michael Nalli
    text: Michael Nalli detailed the soil discrepancies at the middle school field,
      including low organic matter, broadleaf weeds, surface compaction, and nutrient
      deficiencies. He proposed a five-step remediation plan involving core aeration,
      sandy loam topsoil, lime and nitrogen fertilizer (with city waiver), overseeding,
      and a herbicide waiver to restore the field.
  - seconds: 3852
